      {
        "y": 88,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 493.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Fairly small difficulties: a snag, a hitch, a glitch. Glitch usually refers to a technical problem of"
      },
      {
        "y": 100.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 307.5,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "some kind; the other two words are more general."
      },
      {
        "y": 112.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 213.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "More important difficulties:"
      },
      {
        "y": 124,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 366.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A setback means that progress has been stopped by something."
      },
      {
        "y": 136,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 381.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A stumbling block is something that prevents action or agreement."
      },
      {
        "y": 148,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 352.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A pitfall is an unexpected difficulty (often used in the plural)."
      },
      {
        "y": 160,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 420.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An obstacle is anything that stops progress, either literally or metaphorically."
      },
      {
        "y": 172,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 428.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An impediment is something that prevents free action, progress or movement."
      },
      {
        "y": 184,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 474,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A dilemma is a situation where a difficult choice has to be made between two, sometimes"
      },
      {
        "y": 196.4,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 202.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "unpleasant, alternatives."
      },
      {
        "y": 208,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 399.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "An ordeal is a severe experience, which is very difficult, painful or tiring."
      },
      {
